# Local installation does not require a cloud API key.
# setup generates local/settings.yaml and an isolated Hermes home.
# Runtime launchers remove inherited cloud credentials from child environments.
# The API binds to 127.0.0.1; do not expose an agent with filesystem tools publicly.
# Optional API authentication (configure through your own launch environment):
# ROI_SWARM_API_KEY=<generate-your-own-random-token>
